<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2224_8405.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unnser freündtlich dienst und gruos zuvor, unß
<lb n="2"/>hat <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Georgen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rauner</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gwester</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">saltzfactor</unclear> zu
<lb n="3"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-338" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Fiessen</placeName> bericht, das <persName resp="#ner">Hanns Jacob</persName>, und <persName resp="#ner">Ulrich
<lb n="4"/>Schlapperitz</persName> vatter und sohn, in dz saltzambt
<lb n="5"/>gehörig, schuldig verbleiben. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">294</unclear> fl. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">43</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kr</unclear>.
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Doch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dz</unclear> er sich zu <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diser</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">post</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gelangten</unclear>
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anfang</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bej</unclear> Ime <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">derenthalben</unclear> ein richtikheit
<lb n="8"/>haben khünde, alß ersuochen wir Euch hiemit
<lb n="9"/>Ir wollet die verfuegung thuen, das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">von</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">besagten</unclear>
<lb n="10"/>Hanns Jacob, und Ulrich Schlapperitz erholten
<lb n="11"/>Georgen Rauner die bezalung fürderlich ge-
<lb n="12"/>laist werde, daran erzaigt Ir unns angenembs
<lb n="13"/>gefallen, so wir annderwerts zuerwidern zu-
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begebender</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">glegenheit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ingedennkh</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wellen</unclear>,
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Datum</unclear> <origPlace ref="stadtasg-places-14" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ynsprugg</unclear></origPlace>. <origDate when="1620-08-03" resp="#ner">den. 3. Augustj. Anno 1620</origDate>.
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Roem</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Kay</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mt</unclear>. auch fr. dt. <persName role="issuer" resp="#ner">Leopoldi</persName> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mitinte</unclear>-
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ressierter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ertzhertzogen</unclear> zu <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-91" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Oesterreich</placeName> etc.
<lb n="18"/>Praesident und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Camer</unclear> <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Räthe</unclear></orgName>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">oo</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Lannden</unclear>.
<lb n="19"/><persName role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gschwendtner</unclear></persName>
<lb n="20"/><persName role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Aschall</unclear></persName>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2224_8406.jpg" n="2"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2224_8407.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2224_8408.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ersamen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weisen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">N</unclear>. <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burgermaister
<lb n="22"/>und Rath der Statt St. Gallen</orgName> unnsern
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gueten</unclear> fründen.
<lb n="24"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sanct</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Galln</unclear></placeName>.
</p>
